frida (16.2.5~pirogue1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release.
  * Delete patch:
     - stop-looking-at-main.diff (no longer needed).
  * Refresh patch:
     - adjust-versioning-for-debian-tags.diff (context updated).
  * Adjust buildsystem:
     - Switch from none to makefile.
     - Delete the dh_auto_build override.
     - Add dh_auto_clean override, cleaning build/; letting `make clean`
       run would trigger issues otherwise.
     - Additionally clean the deps/ directory, where SDKs are downloaded.
     - Also run `git clean -xdf` in each submodule: __pycache__/
       directories appear in various places, but we also have some other
       things, like subprojects/frida-gum inside subprojects/frida-core.
  * Add patches:
     - fix-python-includes.diff to make sure both pyconfig.h and Python.h
       are found.
     - adjust-default-prefix.diff to use /usr instead of /usr/local.
  * Disable test suite for the time being.
  * Delete dh_python3 override, no longer needed.
  * Delete variables that are no longer needed.

 -- Cyril Brulebois <cyril@debamax.com>  Wed, 22 May 2024 00:01:10 +0200

